{
  "description": "Our closing stock per item against the legacy Item Wise Closing Stock report (W1-14 rehearsal 2): which of our three figures the report shows (the computation from the document lines, the item opening ± the stock-record lines, the latest running balance), and, per document type, where the document lines and the stock-record lines disagree. Rows only for items whose report quantity differs from the computation, in item-code order; an item missing from the report counts as not listed, a code listed twice is added up.",
